    "detailed_description": "Crisis Control is a strategy game where you command the fire department, medical services, police department and the technical squad to protect a small village for various emergencies. If you and up to 3 players are doing your job right, the city will grow bigger and new opportunities for additional departments and vehicles will appear but so do the crisis with new incidents and attacks which will be more dangerous and complex. Every shift is a new challenge within the procedural generated maps and tons of mods available in multiplayer and easy accessible via the Steam Workshop.",
    "about_the_game": "Crisis Control is a strategy game where you command the fire department, medical services, police department and the technical squad to protect a small village for various emergencies. If you and up to 3 players are doing your job right, the city will grow bigger and new opportunities for additional departments and vehicles will appear but so do the crisis with new incidents and attacks which will be more dangerous and complex. Every shift is a new challenge within the procedural generated maps and tons of mods available in multiplayer and easy accessible via the Steam Workshop.",
    "short_description": "Crisis Control is a strategy game where you and up to 3 friends command firefighters, medics, police officers and technicans to protect a small, rapidly growing village from natural but also human-made desasters.",
